---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
import FAQ from '../components/FAQ.astro';
import { services, company } from '../data';
const roleCount = services.reduce((total, service) => total + service.roles.length, 0);
---
<Layout title="Foreign workforce recruitment for Sri Lankan employers" description="Victoria Foreign Employment coordinates foreign workforce recruitment for Sri Lankan employers, principally sourcing from India and Nepal.">
  <section class="company-hero">
    <div class="container company-hero-grid">
      <div class="company-hero-main"><p class="eyebrow">VICTORIA GROUP ASSOCIATED BUSINESS</p><h1>Foreign workforce recruitment.<br/><em>Accountable to your business.</em></h1><p class="company-hero-lead">Victoria coordinates the recruitment work between a Sri Lankan employer’s requirement and suitable candidates sourced principally from India and Nepal.</p><div class="company-hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/contact/">Submit a workforce requirement <Icon name="up-right" size={20}/></a><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Review the company <Icon/></a></div></div>
      <aside class="company-credential" aria-label="Company profile summary"><div class="credential-head"><span>COMPANY PROFILE</span><span>VFE / LK</span></div><div class="credential-monogram" aria-hidden="true">V</div><h2>{company.legalName}</h2><dl><div><dt>Market served</dt><dd>Sri Lankan employers</dd></div><div><dt>Principal sourcing</dt><dd>India · Nepal</dd></div><div><dt>Operating focus</dt><dd>Recruitment & coordination</dd></div><div><dt>Company reference</dt><dd>PV00370631*</dd></div></dl><p>*Reference reproduced from supplied company material; statutory status is pending company verification before public launch.</p></aside>
    </div>
    <div class="container company-hero-ledger"><span>Employer briefing</span><span>International sourcing</span><span>Candidate screening</span><span>Selection coordination</span><span>Travel & visa coordination*</span></div>
  </section>
  <section class="section company-case"><div class="container company-case-grid"><div class="company-case-title" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">THE COMPANY</p><h2>One point of coordination.<br/><em>From requirement to mobilisation.</em></h2></div><div class="company-case-copy" data-reveal><p class="large-copy">Employers do not need a story about every worker. They need a recruitment company that understands the brief, manages the moving parts, and communicates clearly.</p><p>Victoria’s role begins with your required trades, headcount, location, working conditions and start period. The company then coordinates sourcing, interviews and screening, candidate matching, selection, and agreed documentation, visa and travel activity.</p><a class="text-link" href="/employers/">See how an engagement works <Icon/></a></div><div class="company-case-image" data-reveal><picture><source srcset="/images/workforce-720.webp 720w, /images/workforce-1280.webp 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 58vw" type="image/webp"/><img src="/images/workforce-1280.webp" alt="Illustrative recruitment context: construction professionals reviewing plans" width="1280" height="853"/></picture><span>ILLUSTRATIVE RECRUITMENT CONTEXT · NOT A VICTORIA PLACEMENT</span></div><ol class="company-case-steps"><li><span>01</span><strong>Define</strong><small>Role, headcount and conditions</small></li><li><span>02</span><strong>Source</strong><small>Principally India and Nepal</small></li><li><span>03</span><strong>Select</strong><small>Interview, screen and agree</small></li><li><span>04</span><strong>Coordinate</strong><small>Documentation and mobilisation scope</small></li></ol></div></section>
  <section class="section workforce-desk" id="workforce-desk"><div class="container"><div class="desk-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">WORKFORCE DESK · {roleCount} ROLE TYPES</p><h2>Tell us what the business needs.</h2></div><p>Use this catalogue to start a requirement. These are recruitment categories rather than advertised vacancies; current candidate availability is confirmed during the enquiry.</p></div><div class="desk-table" role="list">{services.map(service => <article class="desk-row" role="listitem" data-reveal><div class="desk-code">{service.number}</div><div class="desk-sector"><span>SECTOR</span><h3>{service.name}</h3><p>{service.description}</p></div><div class="desk-roles"><span>ROLE TYPES</span><p>{service.roles.join(' · ')}</p></div><a href={`/contact/?sector=${service.slug}`} aria-label={`Request ${service.name}`}><span>Start request</span><Icon name="up-right"/></a></article>)}</div><div class="desk-foot"><p>Need several categories or a role that is not listed?</p><a class="button button-light" href="/contact/">Send a custom brief <Icon name="up-right"/></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section company-proof"><div class="container proof-grid"><div data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">WHY VICTORIA</p><h2>Credibility comes from<br/><em>clear responsibility.</em></h2></div><div class="proof-principles"><article data-reveal><span>01</span><h3>A business-first brief</h3><p>Recruitment begins with the employer’s actual operating requirement—not a generic list of people.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>02</span><h3>Direct source-market selection</h3><p>The supplied operating model includes travelling to sourcing countries to interview and assess suitable candidates.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>03</span><h3>Defined coordination</h3><p>Responsibilities for selection, documents, travel, visa activity and arrival are agreed for each engagement.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>04</span><h3>Leadership-led relationships</h3><p>Dr. David Navaratnaraj leads business development and relationship building in the supplied company material.</p></article></div></div></section>
  <section class="section company-leadership"><div class="container leadership-card" data-reveal><div class="leadership-index">V / 01</div><div><p class="eyebrow">COMPANY LEADERSHIP</p><h2>Dr. David Navaratnaraj</h2><p class="large-copy">Relationship-led business development for Victoria Foreign Employment.</p></div><div><p>His supplied professional profile describes experience across engineering, business management, international business and strategic networking, and identifies him as a director of Victoria-associated businesses.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Read the company profile <Icon/></a><small>Profile statements remain subject to company approval and credential verification.</small></div></div></section>
  <section class="section home-faq"><div class="container faq-layout"><div data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">EMPLOYER DUE DILIGENCE</p><h2>Questions to settle<br/><em>before engagement.</em></h2><a class="text-link" href="/employers/#questions">All employer questions <Icon/></a></div><FAQ limit={3}/></div></section>
  <CTA/>
</Layout>
